refract (0.1.4) unstable; urgency=medium

  * The window is now GTK 4 instead of GLFW, so Desk stays on the glasses
    when GNOME moves fullscreen windows around.
  * Fix badly laggy Desk side screens (capture streams were starved after
    every monitor layout change; idle screens were throttled to 8 Hz).
  * Desk layout presets (Wide / Tight / Compact) to cut the head turn.
  * Accelerometer temple taps (right: HUD, left: recenter).
  * HUD About page with versions and licences.
  * Refuse to start, with a notification, if the glasses will not switch to
    side-by-side or the VITURE library cannot load.
  * First .deb release.

